'''Rei''' is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.9 Update|Version 2.2.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Rei
|image = E 096.png
|appearance = [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 900¢ - 3555¢
}}

==Enemy==
Rei is relatively fast enemy with a fairly high amount of HP(depending on magnification), aswell as a rapid attack rate, similar to [[Fuu (Enemy)|Fuu]]. Additionally, this character is capable of delivering substantial damage with each strike.

Fortunately, Rei-being a melee, means it is important to note that their effective range is notably limited, which exposes them to vulnerability from numerous opposing units, particularly when considering their Floating trait, bearing some resemblance to [[Serum (Enemy)|Serum]] to a certain extent.

